### 1. Проверка статуса
GET http://localhost:3000/status

### 2. Добавляем BTC (с правильным токеном)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cryptos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer my_super_secret_token_123

{
  "symbol": "BTC",
  "name": "Bitcoin"
}

### 3. Получаем список
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cryptos
Authorization: Bearer my_super_secret_token_123

### 4. Получить историю цен для BTC (id=1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cryptos/1/history
Authorization: Bearer my_super_secret_token_123

### 5. Добавляем ETH
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cryptos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer my_super_secret_token_123

{
  "symbol": "ETH",
  "name": "Ethereum"
}

### 6. Удаляем BTC (id=1)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/cryptos/1
Authorization: Bearer my_super_secret_token_123